         --></pre>
            <h2>Introduction:</h2>
            <p>
                Pufka is your base of learning materials for CompSci in general.
            </p>
            <p>
                [% INCLUDE out/stats.txt %]
            </p>
            <p>
                You may find the base document
                <a href="https://github.com/agvxov/pufka_public/blob/master/pufka.cdd">here</a>
                .<br/>
                You may find the HTML rendering pipe-line
                <a href="https://github.com/agvxov/cdd">here</a>
                .<br/>
            </p>
            <h2>Complete table of contents:</h2>
            <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
                <ul>
                [% FOREACH line IN toc %]
                    [% IF line == ">" %]
                        <ul>
                    [% ELSIF line == "<" %]
                        </ul>
                    [% ELSE %]
                        <li><a href="/[% line %]">[% title(line) %]</a></li>
                    [% END %]
                [% END %]
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
</html>
